{
  "epId": 11434,
  "name": "娜斯佳",
  "desc": "<p>奥古洛夫镇的居民，因卡谢伊的实验而发生异变。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/09/27/326985891/a9c6c2f2bed1f88d0bc41d425fcc8c78_3790071112755882343.png",
